###

### 5.3 Create Job - ADMIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "SAP ABAP Developer",
  "department": "SAP",
  "employmentType": "Full Time",
  "experience": "3+ Years",
  "location": "Hyderabad, India",
  "status": "Published",
