### C.2 HR - Bulk Upload Employees From Excel
# Put an .xlsx or .xls file next to this test.http file.
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ProliantBoundary

------ProliantBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="employees.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./employees.xlsx
------ProliantBoundary--

###

### C.3 HR - Bulk Upload Without a File (expected 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ProliantBoundary

------ProliantBoundary--

