### D1 Department Administrator dashboard statistics (aggregate, all departments)
# status: ALL | IN_INTERVIEW | SELECTED | JOINED
# period: from/to (YYYY-MM-DD)  OR  year [+ month 1-12 | quarter 1-4]
GET {{baseUrl}}/department-admin/dashboard/statistics?department=&status=ALL&year=2026&quarter=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### D2 HR / Global Admin: same summary for reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/recruitment-summary?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### D3 HR / Global Admin: email the aggregate summary (manual; no schedule)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports/recruitment-summary/email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recipients": ["department.head@example.com"], "year": 2026 }
